  "analysis_md": "设 $G(x,y,z)=F(x+y,y-z,z-x)$，\n\n$$\\vec{n}=(G'_x,G'_y,G'_z)=(F'_u-F'_w,F'_u+F'_v,F'_w-F'_v)=(2,-4,3),$$\n\n法线 $\\frac{x-4}{2}=\\frac{y+1}{-4}=\\frac{z-2}{3}$。",
